# U69 — Admin, org, enterprise and compliance APIs
Priority: P2. Size: L. Depends on: U61.

Facts: Admin API org/members/invites/workspaces/API keys/rate limits/service accounts/WIF/CMEK/compliance settings are out of beta under `client.organization` (2026-09-30). Personal keys and service-account keys (08-27); key expiration (07-08); Rate Limits API (04-24); Workload Identity Federation (05-04). User profiles `/v1/user_profiles` with `enforcement_status` / `enforcement_actions` (10-20/21). Org webhooks `webhooks-2026-10-07` (restriction/ban events, access via account team). Claude Tag API beta `experimental-claude-tag-2026-10-21`, Enterprise only, Admin key with `read:claude_tag`/`write:claude_tag`. Inference hooks GA for Enterprise. Org admins can disable web fetch / set domain rules in Console. Compliance API: local and remote Cowork/Claude Code sessions, Claude in Chrome, Claude Science, Office agents transcripts, `user_preferences` (10-15), unified-experience chats and Claude Docs Word download (10-08); Activity Feed no longer returns filenames/titles (09-24). `anthropic-workspace-id` response header (08-11). Send `anthropic-version` on Enterprise endpoints.

Requirements: audit existing admin/compliance modules; add missing endpoints read-only first, writes behind explicit confirm flags; Admin keys never logged; pagination via `page`/`next_page`; fixtures-based tests; docs note which pieces are Enterprise-only.
